Package: aqueco
Title: Integrated Analysis and Visualization of Amplicon Microbiome Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Xucong", "Lyu", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "lvxvcong@outlook.com")
Description: A modular workflow for importing, validating, summarizing, analyzing,
    and visualizing 16S and ITS amplicon sequencing data, including taxonomic
    composition, alpha and beta diversity, environmental factor analysis, correlation and group-wise Mantel testing,
    ordination, beta diversity decomposition, RDA/CCA constrained ordination, and variation partitioning analysis (VPA).
